 "title": "Raising a work order",
 "duration": 84.92,
 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 0.08,
   "end": 8.62,
   "text": "Report a fault as a work order with its priority, place and technician, so nothing gets forgotten.",
   "step": 0,
   "url": "",
   "intro": true
  },
  {
   "start": 8.62,
   "end": 14.37,
   "text": "Maintenance shows every open job in the mall, and which ones are late.",
   "step": 1,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.37,
   "end": 21.02,
   "text": "Open work orders, how many are urgent, and how many are past their agreed time.",
   "step": 2,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.02,
   "end": 26.05,
   "text": "Most urgent lists what to do first: emergencies at the top.",
   "step": 3,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.05,
   "end": 33.33,
   "text": "Choose New work order. Tenants' requests from their portal arrive here by themselves.",
   "step": 4,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance/orders/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.33,
   "end": 39.09,
   "text": "Say what is wrong, in a few words.",
   "step": 5,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance/orders/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.09,
   "end": 42.96,
   "text": "The trade: it decides who is told.",
   "step": 6,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance/orders/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.96,
   "end": 49.21,
   "text": "The priority. Each one has its own time to respond and to fix.",
   "step": 7,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance/orders/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.21,
   "end": 57.2,
   "text": "Where it is: a unit, an asset, or a place in the common area.",
   "step": 8,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance/orders/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.2,
   "end": 62.51,
   "text": "What you saw and what was already done.",
   "step": 9,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance/orders/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.51,
   "end": 67.56,
   "text": "Choose the technician now, or leave it for the supervisor.",
   "step": 10,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance/orders/new"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.56,
   "end": 74.79,
   "text": "Raise the work order. The technician is told at once, and the clocks start.",
   "step": 11,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance/orders/97"
  },
  {
   "start": 74.79,
   "end": 80.26,
   "text": "These two timers show the time left to respond and to fix.",
   "step": 12,
   "url": "/admin/maintenance/orders/97"
  }
